<title>USA: Minn unemployment rate stays at record low 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Minn unemployment rate stays at record low 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minnesota's seasonally adjusted unemployment rate remained at a record monthly low of three percent in March, the same as February, the Minnesota Department of Economic Security reported Thursday.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted rate for March 1996 was 3.9 percent, the department noted.</p>
<p>The unadjusted rate dropped 0.2 percent to 3.4 percent in March from February as well, the department reported. The unadjusted rate for March 1996 was 4.3 percent, the department noted.</p>
<p>((--David Bailey, 312-408-8647))</p>
